│       1→"""Symbolic base functions for DNA2 energy model.
│       2→
│       3→This function is based on the oxDNA2 model paper found here:
│       4→https://ora.ox.ac.uk/objects/uuid:241ae8d5-2092-4b24-b1d0-3fb7482b7bcd/files/m7422ee58d9747bbd7af00d6435b570e6
│       5→page 16, eq A5
│       6→"""
│       7→
│       8→
│       9→def f6(theta: float, a: float, b: float) -> float:
│      10→    """This is a symbolic representation of the f6 base function.
│      11→
│      12→    Equation A5 from the oxDNA2 paper.
│      13→
│      14→    This function has described has 1 case:
│      15→    1. theta >= b
│      16→    2. Otherwise
│      17→    """
│      18→    value = 0
│      19→    if theta >= b:
│      20→        value = a / 2 * (theta - b) ** 2
│      21→
│      22→    return value
│      23→
│  
