│       1→"""Symbolic base functions for DNA2 energy model.
│       2→
│       3→This function is based on the oxDNA2 model paper found here:
│       4→https://ora.ox.ac.uk/objects/uuid:241ae8d5-2092-4b24-b1d0-3fb7482b7bcd/files/m7422ee58d9747bbd7af00d6435b570e6
