│       6→
│       7→Migrated from JAX to MindSpore for Ascend NPU support.
│       8→"""
│       9→
│      10→
│      11→def f6(theta: float, a: float, b: float) -> float:
│      12→    """This is a symbolic representation of the f6 base function.
│      13→
│      14→    Equation A5 from the oxDNA2 paper.
│      15→
│      16→    This function has described has 1 case:
│      17→    1. theta >= b
│      18→    2. Otherwise
│      19→    """
│      20→    value = 0
│      21→    if theta >= b:
│      22→        value = a / 2 * (theta - b) ** 2
│      23→
│      24→    return value
│      25→
