     ```python
     def periodic(box_size: float) -> Tuple[Callable, Callable]:
         def displacement_fn(ra: Tensor, rb: Tensor) -> Tensor:
             dr = rb - ra
             dr = dr - box_size * mnp.round(dr / box_size)
             return dr
         def shift_fn(r: Tensor, dr: Tensor) -> Tensor:
             new_r = r + dr
             new_r = new_r % box_size
             return new_r
         return displacement_fn, shift_fn
     ```

