│     113→        forces (Tensor): The forces under which the extensions were measured
│     114→        init_guess (Tensor): An initial guess for the parameters of the WLC model, ordered as [L_0, L_p, K]
│     115→        kT (float): the temperature
│     116→        implicit_diff (bool): Kept for API compatibility, not used in MindSpore version
│     117→
│     118→    Returns:
