│     190→def torsion(torques: Tensor, extensions: Tensor, twists: Tensor) -> tuple[float, float]:
│     191→    """Computes the relevant summary statistics from torsion experiments.
│     192→
│     193→    Following Assenza and Perez (JCTC 2022), the torsional modulus and twist-stretch coupling can be
│     194→    computed via linear fits to the extension and twist of a duplex under torque (when combined with
│     195→    similar statistics from stretching experiments). This function computes the slopes of these
│     196→    linear fits
│     197→
│     198→    Args:
│     199→        torques (Tensor): the torques applied to the polymer
│     200→        extensions (Tensor): the equilibrium extensions under the applied torques
│     201→        twists (Tensor): the equilibrium twists under the applied torques
│     202→
│     203→    Returns:
