│     284→    """Read a trajectory file object."""
│     285→    # we don't know where we are in the file, but we can be only in one of two
│     286→    # situations: We are at the start of the state or we are in the midle of a
│     287→    # state. If we are in the middle of a state, we need to read until the next
│     288→    # state starts and then parse the states from there. Importantly, we need
