│  命令: git commit -m "$(cat <<'EOF'
Complete JAX to MindSpore migration for Ascend NPU

This commit completes the migration of jax_dna from JAX to MindSpore
for running on Huawei Ascend 910B2 NPU.

Key changes:
- Replaced JAX/jax.numpy with MindSpore/mindspore.numpy
- Replaced jax_md.rigid_body with custom rigid_body module
- Replaced jax.vmap with explicit Python for loops
- Replaced chex.dataclass with @dataclass from dataclasses
- Replaced optax with custom OptimizerState and apply_updates
- Replaced jax.value_and_grad with ops.value_and_grad
- Replaced jax.random.split with custom random_split function
- Added space utility functions (free_displacement, free_shift)
- Added math utility functions (hat_map, safe_norm, safe_normalize)

Modules migrated:
- utils (types, math, helpers, constants, neighbors, units)
- energy (base, potentials, configuration)
- energy/dna1, dna2, rna2, na1 (nucleotide models)
- rigid_body (custom RigidBody, Quaternion classes)
- simulators (base, io, jax_md, oxdna)
- input (trajectory, topology, toml, tree)
- observables (pitch, rise, diameter, propeller, rmse, wlc, etc)
- optimization (objective, optimization, simulator)
- losses (observable_wrappers)
- gradient_estimators (difftre)
- ui (loggers)

Verification: All 8 verification tests passed on CPU mode.

🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
EOF
)"
